{"products":{"206566":{"code":"206566","name":"LEGO Minifigures Shrek Series 71053","listingStatus":"LISTEDINSTOREONLY","onlineDate":null,"url":null,"information":{"description":"Delight any Shrek fan with 1 of 12 collectible characters from the LEGO® Minifigures Shrek Series (71053) mystery box for boys and girls ages 6 and up. Treat a kid or collector and let them enjoy the excitement of discovering which of the 12 random characters the minifigure pack contains – Will it be DreamWorks Animation’s Shrek, Fiona, Donkey, Pinocchio, Gingy, Dragon, Puss in Boots, Thelonious, Big Bad Wolf, Merlin, Lord Farquaad, Fairy Godmother or Prince Charming?\r<br/>Each minifigure comes in a sealed mystery box and most include at least 1 themed accessory for added playtime fun. Kids can display each character alongside their existing collection of Shrek merch or recreate their favorite movie scenes. This small gift idea is a creative way to inspire pretend play for young builders who love LEGO toys.","summary":"<p><strong>Product Features:</strong></p><ul><li>COLLECTIBLE MINIFIGURES &ndash; Kids ages 6 and up can add to their Shrek character collection with 1 surprise toy from this LEGO&reg; Minifigures Shrek Series (71053) mystery box</li><li>DISCOVER 1 OF 12 SHREK TOYS &ndash; Whether they find Shrek, Fiona, Donkey, Puss in Boots or another friend from the swamp, kids can discover which of the 12 random minifigures their box contains</li><li>THEMED ACCESSORIES &ndash; Add to the fun with themed accessories paired to iconic characters, such as Puss in Boots with one of the blind mice, Lord Farquaad with a magic mirror and Gingy with his lollipop</li><li>CREATIVE PLAY &ndash; Inspire young imaginations as girls and boys act out stories and recreate their favorite scenes from the world of Shrek</li><li>SMALL GIFT IDEA FOR KIDS &ndash; These surprise mystery boxes make a fun treat for boys and girls who love imaginative play and Shrek merch</li><li>CREATE A WORLD OF CHARACTERS &ndash